      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town sits where Blue Mountain meets the Susquehanna River, with Cove Mountain to the north and Rye Township to the west.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17,
